  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mtext>&nbsp;ln&nbsp;K</mtext></math><br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mtext>&nbsp;ln&nbsp;K</mtext></math><br /><br /><math> <mrow>  <mo>&#x2212;</mo><mfrac>   <mrow>    <msup>     <mrow>      <mtext>&#x0394;H</mtext></mrow>     <mtext>o</mtext>    </msup>    </mrow>   <mrow>    <mtext>RT</mtext></mrow>  </mfrac>  <mo>+</mo><mfrac>   <mrow>    <msup>     <mrow>      <mtext>&#x0394;S</mtext></mrow>     <mtext>o</mtext>    </msup>    </mrow>   <mtext>R</mtext>  </mfrac>  <mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mtext>K</mtext></mrow></math><br /><br />Therefore <math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi></mrow></mrow><mtext>K&nbsp;vs&nbsp;</mtext><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> graph will be a straight line with slope equal to <math><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> . Since reaction is exothermic, therefore <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></math> itself will be negative resulting in positive slope."
